    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Detail Panel & Information View",
      "id": "detail-panel",
      "intro": "Setiap account memiliki Detail Panel yang dapat diakses dengan mengklik card atau row di main view. Panel ini menampilkan informasi lengkap account dalam satu view dengan layout 2 kolom: Sidebar Identity dan Detail Information.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Membuka Detail Panel",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik salah satu card dari Card View atau row dari Table View.\n• Detail Panel akan muncul di sisi kanan layar (Card View) atau di bawah row (Table View).\n• Panel terbagi menjadi **2 bagian utama**: Sidebar Identity (kiri) dan Detail Information (kanan).\n• **Sidebar Identity** menampilkan Account Identity dengan ID account (#42) dan icon wallet.\n• **Detail Information** menampilkan semua field dalam layout grid 2 kolom yang scrollable.",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(20,184,166,.12);border:1px solid #99f6e4;background:#fff;width:380px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"display:flex;min-height:200px;\"><div style=\"width:120px;padding:16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdfa,#ccfbf1);border-right:1px solid #99f6e4;display:flex;flex-direction:column;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#14b8a6,#0d9488);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"10\"/></svg></div><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Identity</div></div><div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:900;color:#0f172a;\">#42</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;margin-top:2px;\">Account Data</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;padding:14px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:6px;background:#dbeafe;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Account Number</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;font-family:monospace;\">1234567890</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:6px;background:#dcfce7;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Status</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;margin-top:2px;\">ACTIVE</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Account & Balance Information",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:2}\n**Account Information** yang ditampilkan:\n• **Account Number**: Nomor rekening unik\n• **Currency**: Mata uang account (IDR, USD, EUR, dll)\n• **Account Type**: Jenis rekening (SAVINGS, CURRENT, LOAN, dll)\n• **Account Status**: Status rekening (ACTIVE, INACTIVE, CLOSED, DORMANT, dll)\n• **Create Date**: Tanggal pembukaan rekening\n\n**Balance Information**:\n• **Available Balance**: Saldo tersedia yang bisa digunakan untuk transaksi\n• Saldo ditampilkan dalam currency account\n• Real-time balance yang ter-sync dari core banking\n\nSemua field ditampilkan dengan icon berwarna untuk identifikasi visual yang mudah.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "2": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(59,130,246,.1);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;background:#fff;width:320px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #bfdbfe;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eff6ff,#dbeafe);\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Account & Balance</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Account information and balance</div></div><div style=\"padding:12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#dbeafe;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Account Number</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;font-family:monospace;\">1234567890</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef3c7;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Currency</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;\">IDR</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#ccfbf1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0d9488\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Type</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;\">SAVINGS</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#dcfce7;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Status</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;margin-top:2px;\">ACTIVE</div></div></div><div style=\"grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;align-items:start;gap:6px;background:#f0fdf4;padding:8px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #a7f3d0;\"><div style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:5px;background:#dcfce7;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Available Balance</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#16a34a;margin-top:2px;\">Rp 50.000.000</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Credit & Device Information",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:3}\n**Credit Information** (untuk credit account):\n• **Settlement Date**: Tanggal penyelesaian billing cycle\n• **MAD Amount**: Minimum Amount Due (pembayaran minimum)\n• **Grace Date**: Tanggal grace period berakhir\n• **Total Amount Due**: Total tagihan yang harus dibayar\n• **Payment Amount**: Jumlah pembayaran terakhir\n• **Aging Period**: Periode aging untuk overdue account\n\n**Device Information** (device binding):\n• **Device ID**: Identifier unik device yang ter-bind\n• **Binding Status**: Status binding (BOUND, UNBOUND)\n• **Is Trusted**: Apakah device dipercaya (TRUE/FALSE)\n• **Device Model**: Model device (iPhone 12, Samsung Galaxy S21)\n• **OS Version**: Versi sistem operasi (iOS 15.0, Android 12)\n• **Is Rooted**: Apakah device di-root/jailbreak (TRUE/FALSE)\n• **User Agent**: String user agent dari device\n\n> Device binding berguna untuk fraud detection - tracking unusual device access atau device switching pattern.",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "3": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(139,92,246,.1);border:1px solid #ddd6fe;background:#fff;width:320px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd6fe;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5f3ff,#ede9fe);\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Credit & Device Info</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Credit details and device binding</div></div><div style=\"padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #fde68a;background:#fffbeb;padding:10px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#d97706;margin-bottom:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"10\"/></svg>Credit Information</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#92400e;font-weight:700;\">Settlement Date</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;\">2024-01-15</div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#92400e;font-weight:700;\">MAD Amount</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;\">Rp 500.000</div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#92400e;font-weight:700;\">Grace Date</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;\">2024-01-25</div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#92400e;font-weight:700;\">Total Due</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;\">Rp 5.000.000</div></div></div></div><div style=\"border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;background:#f5f3ff;padding:10px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#8b5cf6;margin-bottom:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"7\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><polyline points=\"17 2 12 7 7 2\"/></svg>Device Information</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#6d28d9;font-weight:700;\">Device ID</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;font-family:monospace;\">DEV-ABC123XYZ</div></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#6d28d9;font-weight:700;\">Status</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#16a34a;margin-top:2px;font-weight:700;\">BOUND</div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#6d28d9;font-weight:700;\">Is Trusted</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#16a34a;margin-top:2px;font-weight:700;\">TRUE</div></div></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#6d28d9;font-weight:700;\">Model</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;\">iPhone 12</div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#6d28d9;font-weight:700;\">OS Version</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;\">iOS 15.0</div></div></div><div style=\"border-radius:6px;background:#fee2e2;border:1px solid #fecaca;padding:6px;\"><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#991b1b;font-weight:700;\">Is Rooted</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#dc2626;margin-top:2px;font-weight:700;\">FALSE</div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Customer & Limit Information",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:4}\n**Customer Information**:\n• Data customer yang terkait dengan account\n• Field customer object (detail bergantung pada data yang tersedia)\n\n**Limit Information**:\n• Limit transaksi account\n• Field limit object (detail bergantung pada data yang tersedia)\n\n**Empty State & Field Display**:\n• Jika tidak ada account yang dipilih, panel menampilkan ilustrasi kosong dengan pesan \"No account selected\".\n• Field yang memiliki nilai null/undefined akan menampilkan \"-\".\n• Field dengan object/complex data akan ditampilkan dalam format JSON string.\n\n> Detail panel menampilkan semua field yang ada dalam domain AccountData, memudahkan investigasi fraud dengan informasi lengkap dalam satu view.",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "4": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(20,184,166,.1);border:1px solid #99f6e4;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #99f6e4;background:#f0fdfa;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Detail Panel</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">No account selected</div></div><div style=\"padding:40px 20px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:14px;background:#f1f5f9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 12px;\"><svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"10\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"15\" r=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"15\" r=\"1\"/></svg></div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;margin-bottom:6px;\">No Selection</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;line-height:1.4;\">Click on an account<br/>to view details</div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
